# CognacOS x64 native syscall manifest.
# Format: exported_name reference_service_id argument_count
# IDs are pinned Windows 11 AMD64 reference-image service ordinals, not stable ABI constants.
# The kernel discovers each ID from the built NTDLL stub and maps it to a stable internal handler.
# Windows service ordinals can change between Windows builds; never reuse these for another reference build without revalidation.
NtClose 0x00f 1
NtOpenKey 0x012 3
NtQueryValueKey 0x017 6
NtOpenFile 0x033 6
NtReadFile 0x006 9
NtAllocateVirtualMemory 0x018 6
NtFreeVirtualMemory 0x01e 4
NtProtectVirtualMemory 0x050 5
NtQueryVirtualMemory 0x023 6
NtReadVirtualMemory 0x03f 5
NtWriteVirtualMemory 0x03a 5
NtYieldExecution 0x046 0
NtQueryInformationProcess 0x019 5
NtQueryInformationThread 0x025 5
NtQuerySystemInformation 0x036 4
NtCreateKey 0x145 7
NtSetValueKey 0x146 6
NtDeleteValueKey 0x147 2
NtDeleteKey 0x148 1
NtFlushKey 0x149 1
NtEnumerateKey 0x14a 6
NtEnumerateValueKey 0x14b 6
NtQueryKey 0x14c 5
NtOpenProcess 0x026 4
NtGetNextProcess 0x100 5
NtCreateEvent 0x14d 5
NtSetEvent 0x14e 2
NtResetEvent 0x14f 2
NtWaitForSingleObject 0x150 3
NtOpenEvent 0x151 3
